WEBVTT

00:08:59.556 --> 00:09:01.196
Gina: Throughout my entire career,

00:09:01.196 --> 00:09:03.796
I was always fascinated
by this whole notion

00:09:03.836 --> 00:09:07.556
that I felt sort of like
I was being overprepared

00:09:07.556 --> 00:09:10.596
for these situations where maybe
there was a promotion

00:09:10.636 --> 00:09:14.676
or some particular
opportunity for visibility,

00:09:14.716 --> 00:09:15.996
I would be quite prepared,

00:09:15.996 --> 00:09:19.356
qualified, temperament-wise, ready to go.

00:09:19.396 --> 00:09:22.396
And I would go through these very
extensive selection procedures

00:09:22.396 --> 00:09:25.556
and discover at the end that, in this case
that I'm thinking about,

00:09:25.596 --> 00:09:28.556
there was this gentleman
who got this job that I really wanted.

00:09:28.596 --> 00:09:29.876
This particular situation,

00:09:29.876 --> 00:09:33.596
I was told that the reason was
because it was that person's turn,